# ── Contact form ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com — enter the inbox you want
# messages delivered to and they email you the key. No account, no domain.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is required: the form submits from the browser, because
# Web3Forms rejects server-side calls on the free plan. That makes the key
# public, which is how Web3Forms is designed to be used — it authorises
# delivery to one inbox and nothing else.
#
# Without it the form tells visitors to email directly. It never pretends a
# message was delivered.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local dev, and add the same variable in
# your host's dashboard for production.

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
